# SPA fallback: every non-asset path must serve index.html so the client-side
# router can handle it. Without this, deep links (/tools/rhythm, /music-analytics,
# …) hard-404 on a static host. Understood by both Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
# The 200 (rather than 301/302) keeps the requested URL in the address bar.
/*    /index.html   200
